Assets of the lightring-paper part (task t06-lightring-paper).

- lightring-paper-traj.js: copied from the direct-wave part of the seminar_SBU project (its
  task t11-direct-wave, script S1/make_dw_data.py), made from the data of Cheung
  (2608.29466). The JS variable was renamed to lightring_paper_traj.
- cheung_waveform_top.png, cheung_waveform_bottom.png: the waveform figure of Cheung
  (2608.29466), from waveform.pdf of the paper's LaTeX source (the lightring_paper project),
  split in the blank band between its panels (rows 880-898 are white at 200 dpi):
  `pdftoppm -png -r 200 -singlefile -x 0 -y 0 -W 2783 -H 889 waveform.pdf cheung_waveform_top`
  `pdftoppm -png -r 200 -singlefile -x 0 -y 889 -W 2783 -H 892 waveform.pdf cheung_waveform_bottom`
